diagram:
flowchart TB
 Soil[Unprepared soil] -->|Resident preparation| Ready[Prepared bed]
 Ready -->|Seeds + planting work| Planted[Planted crop]
 Planted -->|Normal mode| Growth[Growing]
 Planted -->|Sandbox: instant growth| Mature[Harvestable]
 Growth -->|Accumulated growing conditions| Mature
 Mature -->|Resident harvesting| Harvest[Harvested bed + residues]
 Growth -->|Explicit clearing: residues only| Harvest
 Mature -->|Explicit clearing: residues only| Harvest
 Harvest -->|Prepare next planting| Ready
 Harvest --> Residues[Leave cover or collect residues]
